! ---------------------------------------------------------------------
! hiipdr-contract with ONE coupling pass per MC iteration (D-214).
!
! D-213 measured that the coupling loop re-solves Te five times per MC
! iteration at frozen radiation field, and that each pass re-anchors
! pdrCoolTref, flattens the measured slope, removes the extrapolation that
! was holding the cell cold, and lets Te step up: 530 -> 4129 -> 8054 ->
! 8245 -> 8283 K inside iteration 6. The march is what carries the cell from
! the extrapolation-inflated cold state to the substitution-starved hot one.
!
! One pass per iteration is the zero-code approximation of the contract as
! stated: MOCASSIN solves the thermal equilibrium once, the chemistry
! answers at that temperature, and the radiation field is rebuilt before
! anything is solved again. If the collapse softens or moves, the pass
! structure is amplifying it.
!
! NOT the full design: that would converge the chemistry against a fixed Te
! over several passes. This has one chemistry call as well, so it also
! removes whatever the chemistry loop was buying (D-119).
! ---------------------------------------------------------------------
! ---------------------------------------------------------------------
! Bisbas et al. (2015) sec 5.4 H II region + PDR at the OWNERSHIP CONTRACT.
!
!   MOCASSIN -> 3D-PDR   ion densities, Ne, Te, dust temperature, dust opacity
!   3D-PDR -> MOCASSIN   molecular content + the heating/cooling that follows
!   MOCASSIN owns        ionization, thermal equilibrium, molecular bookkeeping
!
! D-198. The contract is now IN THE CODE, so this file states no ownership
! keyword at all - there are none left to state. Seven are retired and
! ignored: pdrAtomicH, pdrOwnIon, pdrIonFromMocassin, pdrTeFromMocassin
! (D-193), ionChemRates (D-196/D-198), pdrAllCells and pdrCoolFeedback
! (D-198). A run that sets them says so in the log and proceeds with the
! contract regardless.
!
! What remains below is physics and numerics, not ownership. The fixture is
! kept as the named target of the contract work rather than folded into
! hiipdr, so that "the model at the contract" has an address.
! ---------------------------------------------------------------------
TStellar 40000.
contShape blackbody
LPhot 4.26e13
symmetricXYZ
Hdensity 100.
nebComposition "input/abunV1.in"
TeStart 8000.
maxIterateMC 22 90.
nPhotons 6000000
nx 31
ny 31
nz 31
nbins 600
nuMax 15.
nuMin 1.001e-5
Rin 30.e17
Rout 6.0e19
edges 6.0e19 6.0e19 6.0e19
convLimit 0.10
dustFile 'input/dust_species.dat' 'input/dust_sizes.dat'
MdMg constant 0.011295
pdr 1
pdrDataDir "/home/hmonteiro/software/mocassin-pdr/dataPDR"
pdrNetwork "reduced"
pdrZeta 5.0e-17
pdrCoolants 4 "12co.dat" "12c+.dat" "12c.dat" "16o.dat"
pdrStartIter 4
pdrCoupleIter 1
